<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The ministers of the new covenant</l><l>Riches of Christ unsearchable possess;</l><l>Imparting Christ to all God’s chosen ones,</l><l>Fullness of God, Christ’s Body, is expressed.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The ministers of the new covenant</l><l>Captives of God are, in Christ’s victory move;</l><l>Fragrance of Christ they spread in every place,</l><l>Sweet savor of His knowledge ever prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The ministers of the new covenant</l><l>Inscribe the Spirit as the element</l><l>Into the hearts of all those who believe—</l><l>Letter of Christ to all men evident.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The ministers of the new covenant,</l><l>Mirrors, behold the glory of the Lord;</l><l>Infused with all He is, they are transformed,</l><l>Even as from the Spirit of the Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The ministers of the new covenant,</l><l>Worthless and fragile vessels made of earth;</l><l>Yet what a priceless treasure they contain;</l><l>Glorious Christ in vessels without worth!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Oh, what a high and holy ministry!</l><l>Who for these things is fully competent?</l><l>Only of God can we enabled be,</l><l>As ministers of His new covenant.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Lord, in this ministry we would take part;</l><l>The all-inclusive Christ we would supply;</l><l>This ministry unique we would fulfill:</l><l>The church to build, the Body edify.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
